WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.412
Instead of streamlining border processing, the application contained 177 documented bugs.

00:00:07.362 --> 00:00:12.275
This resulted in over 10,000 Canadians being wrongfully quarantined.

00:00:12.275 --> 00:00:17.012
No officials were held accountable for the forced confinement of citizens.
